// A pose change nobody sees: the actor already has the pose, or it changes again before a line shows.

@actor mira
    name: Mira
    poses: neutral, happy, sad

== kitchen.door
mira (happy): This line sets the pose.
mira (happy): The pose on this line changes nothing.
//    ^^^^^ PIB5010
mira (sad):
// PIB5010
mira (happy): The silent pose change above is never seen.

// Must not trigger

== kitchen.cellar
mira (happy): This line sets the pose.
@call kitchen.door
mira (happy): After a call, the pose may have changed.
mira (sad):
@wait 1s
mira (happy): The sad pose showed during the wait.
mira (sad):
mira: Someone speaks, so the sad pose shows.
-> Look around
    mira (sad): Inside an option, the pose isn't known.
